{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47910","headline":"霅溪夜宴诗 七 · 水神","name":"霅溪夜宴诗 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浪阔波澄秋气凉，沈沈水殿夜初长。\n自怜休退五湖客，何幸追陪百谷王。\n香袅碧云飘几席，觥飞白玉艳椒浆。\n酒酣独泛扁舟去，笑入琴高不死乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"水神","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}